WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.175
The frozen edge.

00:01.913 --> 00:07.747
Beyond Neptune lies a wide belt of icy bodies, Pluto among them, left over from the beginning.

00:08.297 --> 00:13.442
Neptune's pull stirred this region so much that they never came together into a planet.

00:14.045 --> 00:15.699
Some of our comets come from here.
